  data/S1R_ppml.rds: 45c937cd78805d7b13b4c43f4bc4888e93a2ff15e787ad4fb41d77b51f837d89
SEED:      20260719

DEFINITION: A (mean of log gaps)
  theta_A = mean over post cells of [log(trade) - log(y_hat_0)]

COLUMNS:
  pair:         Pair identifier
  theta_A:      Definition A effect estimate
  n_post_cells: Number of qualifying post cells

ROWS: 4182
SUBSET: All treated pairs (including those failing split-half criterion)

INV-048 NOTE:
  This file is the INV-048 successor for S30_moment_power.R, which required
  all 4182 treated pairs. T22_theta_A_treated.csv (ARCHIVED) only had 4120
  split-half qualifying pairs. This file includes the additional 62 pairs
  that qualify as treated but fail the >= 2 cells per half criterion.

